{"h":"<p>“WAN 视频入门”文章：<a href=\"https://civitai.com/articles/11949\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/articles/11949</a><br>广域网运行Pod：<a href=\"https://runpod.io/console/deploy?template=jfenet6l39&amp;ref=0czffee4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><u>https://runpod.io/console/deploy?template=jfenet6l39&amp;ref=0czffee4</u></a></p><p><br><em>Pack 已重新组织为 /kijai/ 以与 Kijai 的包装器一起使用，以及 /native/ 以与本机工作流程一起使用。</em><strong><em>注意：Native ComfyUI 需要“_scaled”CLIP 版本。</em></strong><em><br></em><br><br><em>基本的t2v</em></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f490f908-b81a-4f15-b82c-edc7f6d6f633/width=525/f490f908-b81a-4f15-b82c-edc7f6d6f633.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><em>基本的i2v</em><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f4d32633-c935-4f52-a884-9ad341255afb/width=525/f4d32633-c935-4f52-a884-9ad341255afb.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">基本的v2v</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1b99ec72-395f-4873-b117-e098ee97ca83/width=525/1b99ec72-395f-4873-b117-e098ee97ca83.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong><em>*注意*</em></strong><em>在发布时</em><strong><em>v2v 工作流程</em></strong><em>非常新，并且存在张量不匹配。这可以通过更新来解决。</em></p><p><em>自动 i2v (QWEN2.5VL)</em></p><p><em><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/54affeec-78e3-42c4-8f0e-718277e2a326/width=525/54affeec-78e3-42c4-8f0e-718277e2a326.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></em><br><strong>原生 COMFYUI 工作流程</strong></p><p>t2v 和 i2v 包含在包中，还有：</p><p>t2v（zenkai 提示）<br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/964c23c6-1102-4560-8f59-cc0862a6e962/width=525/964c23c6-1102-4560-8f59-cc0862a6e962.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>i2v (QwenVL)<br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6b77d789-b888-43b5-bcaf-72bcf358fb0c/width=525/6b77d789-b888-43b5-bcaf-72bcf358fb0c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>WAN Companion 工作流程（插值/效果/高档）<br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f49d5e27-bcf2-48bb-a5c4-56059fdd8d6e/width=525/f49d5e27-bcf2-48bb-a5c4-56059fdd8d6e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><br><strong>未来版本包含所有以前的版本</strong></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>\"Getting Started with WAN Video\" Article:<a href=\"https://civitai.com/articles/11949\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/articles/11949</a><br>WAN Runpod:<a href=\"https://runpod.io/console/deploy?template=jfenet6l39&amp;ref=0czffee4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><u>https://runpod.io/console/deploy?template=jfenet6l39&amp;ref=0czffee4</u></a></p><p><br><em>Pack has been reorganized into /kijai/ for use with Kijai's wrapper &amp; /native/ for use with native workflows.</em><strong><em>Note: Native ComfyUI requires the \"_scaled\" CLIP version.</em></strong><em><br></em><br><br><em>basic t2v</em></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f490f908-b81a-4f15-b82c-edc7f6d6f633/width=525/f490f908-b81a-4f15-b82c-edc7f6d6f633.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><em>basic i2v</em><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f4d32633-c935-4f52-a884-9ad341255afb/width=525/f4d32633-c935-4f52-a884-9ad341255afb.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">basic v2v</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1b99ec72-395f-4873-b117-e098ee97ca83/width=525/1b99ec72-395f-4873-b117-e098ee97ca83.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong><em>*note*</em></strong><em>at time of posting the</em><strong><em>v2v workflow</em></strong><em>is very new and there is a tensor mismatch. This may be addressed by an update.</em></p><p><em>Automatic i2v (QWEN2.5VL)</em></p><p><em><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/54affeec-78e3-42c4-8f0e-718277e2a326/width=525/54affeec-78e3-42c4-8f0e-718277e2a326.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></em><br><strong>NATIVE COMFYUI WORKFLOWS</strong></p><p>t2v &amp; i2v in pack, with these also:</p><p>t2v (zenkai prompt)<br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/964c23c6-1102-4560-8f59-cc0862a6e962/width=525/964c23c6-1102-4560-8f59-cc0862a6e962.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>i2v (QwenVL)<br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6b77d789-b888-43b5-bcaf-72bcf358fb0c/width=525/6b77d789-b888-43b5-bcaf-72bcf358fb0c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>WAN Companion workflow (interpolation/effects/upscale)<br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f49d5e27-bcf2-48bb-a5c4-56059fdd8d6e/width=525/f49d5e27-bcf2-48bb-a5c4-56059fdd8d6e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><br><strong>future versions contain all previous versions</strong></p>"}}